          <a href="https://www.mbacrystalball.com/blog/2023/07/24/how-mba-helps-career-change/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MBA Crystal Ball: How an MBA helps career change</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          Indian executive MBA fee ranges across IIMs, ISB, and other top institutes for 2026.
          <a href="https://bschool.careers360.com/articles/mba-fees-in-india-2026-28-iim-private-government-executive-mba-fee-structure" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Careers360: MBA fees in India 2026-28</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          Product manager salary bands in India by experience level and company type.
          <a href="https://www.productleadership.com/product-manager-salary-in-india/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Product Leadership: Product Manager Salary in India</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          Business analyst salary ranges in India across experience levels for 2026.
          <a href="https://www.eicta.iitk.ac.in/knowledge-hub/data-analytics/business-analyst-salary-in-india" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IIT Kanpur E&ICT Academy: Business Analyst Salary in India</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          PMP certification value and salary premium data for certified project managers.
          <a href="https://blog.masterofproject.com/pmp-certification-in-india/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PMP Certification in India 2026</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          Project Management Institute (PMI) India official certification and framework information.
          <a href="https://www.pmi.org.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PMI India</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          Scrum Master and Certified Scrum Product Owner salary data in India for 2025-26.
          <a href="https://staragile.com/info/agile-and-scrum/certified-scrum-product-owner-salary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">StarAgile: Certified Scrum Product Owner Salary</a>
        </li>
        <li>
